## `02` &nbsp;Where the time goes

The numbers come from WakaTime and the GitHub GraphQL API, and a scheduled Action redraws them every six hours. I render the SVGs myself in [`src/cards`](src/cards) instead of pointing at one of the usual badge services. Those get rate limited, and when they do your profile sits there showing a broken image until somebody notices. Dark and light versions are both committed and swapped with `prefers-color-scheme`.

